//|
//| A live Expert Advisor. The signal logic is the family partial the Strategy Tester parity battery
//| checks against the oracle (engine/research/mql5/templates/family_*.j2); bars, execution and every
//| guardrail below are live-only. The strategy replays the last InpHistoryBars closed bars to build its
//| indicator and position state, then trades only the intent of each newly closed bar, at the next open.
//| Live differences from the backtest, by design: an exit is always taken at once (the backtest defers
//| exits inside no-trade hours), and an entry the guardrails refuse is dropped, never deferred.
//+------------------------------------------------------------------+
